# Hand-off files used while pairing; never part of a change
_changes.patch
_commit_msg.txt

# Benchmark output. Runs against the local stack are cheap and repeatable, so the
# report is not a source of truth and is not kept.
#
# The contents rather than the directory: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so ignoring `evaluation/reports/` would make the
# exception below a line that looks like it works and does not.
evaluation/reports/*
# A run against Azure is neither. It needs a deployed environment that exists for
# an afternoon and costs money, and the environment it measured is destroyed
# within the hour — so this one cannot be reproduced by running it again, and is
# committed for the same reason docs/measurements is.
!evaluation/reports/azure-*.json

# Personal development journal, not part of the repository
NOTAS_DE_DESARROLLO.md
